{
  "frame": "mobile-detail",
  "source": "figma/frames/mobile-detail.png (export 1x). O limite de chamadas MCP do plano Starter foi atingido no primeiro get_metadata, então cada valor foi medido no PNG: 'box' compara o retângulo do elemento no DOM; 'ink' compara a caixa dos pixels visíveis (texto, ícone), detectada com o mesmo limiar no PNG do Figma e na captura do app.",
  "elements": [
    {
      "id": "back-button",
      "selector": "role=button[name=\"Voltar\"]",
      "measure": "box",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 22,
      "w": 36,
      "h": 36
    },
    {
      "id": "image",
      "selector": "role=main >> role=img >> nth=0",
      "measure": "box",
      "x": 28,
      "y": 66,
      "w": 358,
      "h": 350
    },
    {
      "id": "title",
      "selector": "role=heading[level=1]",
      "measure": "ink",
      "x": 25,
      "y": 430,
      "w": 190,
      "h": 20,
      "font": {
        "size": 20,
        "weight": 700,
        "lineHeight": 28
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "description",
      "selector": "role=heading[level=1] >> xpath=../following-sibling::p[1]",
      "measure": "ink",
      "x": 24,
      "y": 469,
      "w": 344,
      "h": 59,
      "tolerance": 2,
      "anchorOnly": true
    },
    {
      "id": "edition-legend",
      "selector": "text=\"Edição:\"",
      "measure": "ink",
      "x": 25,
      "y": 548,
      "w": 59,
      "h": 16,
      "relativeTo": {
        "id": "description",
        "edge": "bottom"
      },
      "font": {
        "size": 15,
        "weight": 700
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "edition-selected",
      "selector": "role=radio[checked=true]",
      "measure": "box",
      "x": 132,
      "y": 570,
      "w": 46,
      "h": 28,
      "relativeTo": {
        "id": "description",
        "edge": "bottom"
      },
      "ignore": [
        "x"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "token-id",
      "selector": "role=term >> nth=0 >> xpath=..",
      "measure": "ink",
      "x": 25,
      "y": 615,
      "w": 160,
      "h": 11,
      "relativeTo": {
        "id": "description",
        "edge": "bottom"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-label",
      "selector": "data-testid=purchase-row >> text=\"Qtd.\"",
